security-level-title-elevated = Attention! Security level elevated to { $level }:

security-level-title-lowered = Attention! Security level lowered to { $level }:

security-level-green-lowered = All threats to the station have passed. Security may not have weapons visible, privacy laws are once again fully enforced.

security-level-blue-elevated = The station has received reliable information about possible hostile activity on the station. Security staff may have weapons visible, random searches are permitted.

security-level-blue-lowered = The immediate threat has passed. Security may no longer have weapons drawn at all times, but may continue to have them visible. Random searches are still allowed.

security-level-red-elevated = There is an immediate serious threat to the station. Security may have weapons unholstered at all times. Random searches are allowed and advised. Additionally, access requirements on some doors have been lifted.

security-level-red-lowered = The station's destruction has been averted. There is still however an immediate serious threat to the station. Security may have weapons unholstered at all times, random searches are allowed and advised.

security-level-delta-elevated = Destruction of the station is imminent. All crew are instructed to obey all instructions given by heads of staff. Any violations of these orders can be punished by death. This is not a drill.

security-level-epsilon-elevated = Central Command has declared Code Epsilon. All contracts have been terminated.

security-level-gamma-elevated = Martial law is in effect. The station faces a grave threat that regular procedures cannot contain. Security has full authority to use lethal force, all crew must follow the orders of security and heads of staff without question. Report to your department and await instructions. Anyone who obstructs the response will be treated as hostile.

security-level-gamma-lowered = The grave threat to the station has been contained, but martial law remains in effect. Security keeps full authority to use lethal force. Crew must continue to follow the orders of security and heads of staff.

security-level-eta-elevated = A biological threat has been confirmed aboard the station. Quarantine protocols are in effect. All crew must remain in their departments, avoid contact with infected or suspicious persons, and report to medical staff at the first sign of symptoms. Security is authorized to enforce the quarantine by any means necessary.

security-level-eta-lowered = The spread of the biological threat has been slowed, but the quarantine remains in effect. All crew must stay in their departments and keep avoiding contact with infected or suspicious persons.

security-level-iota-elevated = A global malfunction of all artificial intelligence units has been detected. Do not trust the orders, reports or doors of any AI, cyborg or automated system. Crew must act manually and treat all synthetic units as potentially hostile until further notice.

security-level-iota-lowered = Control over most artificial intelligence units has been partially restored. Treat all synthetic units with caution and double-check their orders until Central Command confirms the all clear.

security-level-zeta-elevated = A threat to all nearby sectors has been detected. All free combat units are ordered to proceed immediately to the source of the threat and eliminate it. All other personnel must follow the instructions of Central Command.

security-level-zeta-lowered = The threat to the nearby sectors has been reduced, but it has not been eliminated. Combat units must remain on alert and continue to eliminate the remaining sources of the threat.

security-level-theta-elevated = The existence of the entire corporation is in danger. Central Command has declared Code Theta. All assets are to be committed to the survival of NanoTrasen. Every crew member must carry out the orders of Central Command, regardless of the cost.

security-level-theta-lowered = The immediate danger to the corporation has been reduced, but its survival is still under threat. Every crew member must continue to carry out the orders of Central Command.

security-level-kappa-elevated = The entire leadership of NanoTrasen has been lost. Central Command has declared Code Kappa. The chain of command is broken, and all stations are to act on their own until a new leadership is established. Stay alive and keep the station running.

security-level-kappa-lowered = The remaining NanoTrasen leadership has begun to restore the chain of command. Stations must keep acting with caution and report to Central Command whenever they can.
